      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_b6786891",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: rice_cooker_now; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The meme juxtaposes a modern rice cooker with a 1945 model, implying technological progress. While not explicitly targeting any protected group, it may be perceived as dismissive of historical context or the value of older technology, potentially causing offense to those who appreciate vintage items or associate the 1940s with a specific cultural or historical identity. The intent is to highlight technological advancement through visual contrast, but the framing could be seen as condescending or dismissive of past innovations, which may be interpreted as harmful to those who hold sentimental or historical value for older technology.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_e348690f"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
