      "description": "The user is implicitly projected onto the modern rice cooker (visual material) and the text 'rice cooker now' (textual material), which together represent the contemporary standard of technological advancement. The user is expected to identify with the modern appliance as the superior, current version, contrasting it with the historical 1945 model. This projection is reinforced by the framing of the image as a 'versus' comparison, positioning the user to view the modern cooker as the normative, advanced state.",
